      "content": "I see. To make this useful for my paper, could you provide more detail on the specific lineages or groups that these theories usually associate with these traits? For instance, which groups are typically discussed in the context of higher cognitive ability vs. those associated with higher risk-taking or different temperament profiles? Just trying to understand the actual claims being made in these debates.",
